    "sections": {
        "description": "The Radio Jockey Theme is designed for audio-focused websites that require clear content presentation and organized media sections. It includes layouts for program schedules, show listings, host profiles, podcasts, interviews, announcements, and blog updates. The homepage structure supports featured banners, audio sections, and content blocks that can be arranged through the customizer. The theme includes responsive layouts that adjust across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. It supports playlist integration, embedded audio players, social media links, navigation menus, and typography controls. Additional customization options allow changes to colors, headers, widgets, and page layouts without editing core files. The design maintains a balanced structure suitable for publishing audio content, event information, streaming schedules, and station updates. Compatibility with common plugins allows extended functionality for forms, SEO settings, and media management. The code structure follows standard development practices to support stable performance and easier maintenance across different website setups."
    },
